---
---
<div class="sales-screen-layout">
  <div class="sales-main-panel">
    <div class="mock-input">Buscar producto o escanear código...</div>
    <div class="mock-shortcuts">
      <span>F1 Inicio</span>
      <span>↑↓ Artículos</span>
      <span>F2 Ventas</span>
      <span>F4 Verif. Precio</span>
    </div>
    <div class="workspace-card">
      <span class="icon">🛍️</span>
      <h4>Área de Trabajo de Venta</h4>
      <p>Escanea un código de barras o usa el buscador superior.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div class="sales-cart-panel">
    <span class="client-badge">Público General <small>ID: DEFAULT</small></span>
    <h5>Resumen de Venta</h5>
    <div class="cart-empty-state">
      <span class="icon">🛒</span>
      <p>No hay productos en el carrito</p>
    </div>
    <div class="cart-footer">
      <div class="total-row">
        <span>Total a pagar:</span>
        <strong class="total-val">$0.00</strong>
      </div>
      <button class="btn-checkout">COBRAR [F2]</button>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .sales-screen-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 145px;
    height: 100%;
    background: #0f172a;
    font-family: system-ui, -apple-system, sans-serif;
  }
  .sales-main-panel {
    padding: 0.75rem;
    border-right: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }
  .mock-input {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05);
    border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    padding: 0.4rem 0.6rem;
    border-radius: 6px;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    color: #64748b;
  }
  .mock-shortcuts {
    display: flex;
    gap: 0.25rem;
    font-size: 0.55rem;
    color: #94a3b8;
  }
  .mock-shortcuts span {
    background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.06);
    padding: 0.12rem 0.25rem;
    border-radius: 3px;
  }
  .workspace-card {
    flex: 1;
    border: 1px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.12);
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
  }
  .workspace-card .icon { font-size: 1.4rem; opacity: 0.5; margin-bottom: 0.2rem; }
  .workspace-card h4 { font-size: 0.75rem; color: #f8fafc; }
  .workspace-card p { font-size: 0.6rem; color: #64748b; }
  .sales-cart-panel {
    background: #0b1120;
    padding: 0.6rem;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
  }
  .client-badge { font-size: 0.55rem; color: #10b981; margin-bottom: 0.3rem; }
  .sales-cart-panel h5 { font-size: 0.7rem; color: #f8fafc; margin-bottom: 0.5rem; }
  .cart-empty-state { text-align: center; margin: auto 0; font-size: 0.6rem; color: #64748b; }
  .cart-empty-state .icon { font-size: 1.2rem; display: block; margin-bottom: 0.2rem; }
  .cart-footer { margin-top: auto; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); padding-top: 0.4rem; }
  .total-row { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 0.62rem; color: #94a3b8; margin-bottom: 0.4rem; }
  .total-val { color: #10b981; font-size: 0.85rem; }
  .btn-checkout {
    width: 100%;
    background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.2);
    border: 1px solid #8b5cf6;
    color: #a78bfa;
    padding: 0.35rem;
    border-radius: 5px;
    font-weight: 700;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
  }
</style>